                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3eeb65cb-456d-4657-ba3f-607608f3f872",
                                "sense_id": "7ae24246-5c8f-38d8-b982-e2ecf72be3d9",
                                "text": "Я́ков исче́з одна́жды ра́но у́тром со двора́, взяв на свечу́ де́нег из лампа́дной су́ммы, отпуска́емой ему́ на ру́ки ба́рыней. Он водрузи́л обе́щанную свечу́ пе́ред ико́ной за ра́нней обе́дней.",
                                "translation": "Once, early in the morning, Yakov was nowhere to be seen in the courtyard. He had taken money from the lamp fund given to him in person by his mistress and had placed the promised candle in front of the icon after early mass.",
                                "english": "Once, early in the morning, Yakov was nowhere to be seen in the courtyard. He had taken money from the lamp fund given to him in person by his mistress and had placed the promised candle in front of the icon after early mass."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
